  "prefLabel": "Rev 401.20 Property tax credit",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Rev 401.20 “Property tax credit” means an amount of money to be deducted from a person’s property tax bill. The term includes “tax credit.”\n\nSource. #12027, eff 10-28-16; renumbered by #12925 (formerly Rev 401.19)",
